  "title": "Chicken and Melon Salad",
  "description": "A creamy yogurt and sour cream dressing is perfect for this salad, especially after a bit of curry powder is swirled in. The water chestnuts add a nice crunchiness to the honeydew melon, grapes and moist chicken. Serves ten.",
